---
import { XCircle, CheckCircle } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section class="problem-section">
  <div class="problem-header">
    <h2>API Hijriah yang Anda Pakai <span class="accent">Salah</span> untuk Indonesia</h2>
    <p>
      Hampir semua API Hijriah berbasis Umm al-Qura (Saudi). Kalender ini
      mengikuti otoritas Saudi, bukan keputusan resmi Kemenag Indonesia.
      Hasilnya? Tanggal di aplikasi Anda bisa berbeda ±1 hari dari kenyataan.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="comparison-visual">
    <div class="comparison-card comparison-card--wrong">
      <div class="comparison-badge"><XCircle size={14} /> Umm al-Qura</div>
      <div class="comparison-date">1 Ramadhan 1447 H</div>
      <div class="comparison-gregorian">18 Februari 2026</div>
      <div class="comparison-note">Yang ditampilkan aplikasi Anda</div>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-arrow">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-card comparison-card--right">
      <div class="comparison-badge"><CheckCircle size={14} /> MABIMS</div>
      <div class="comparison-date">30 Sya'ban 1447 H</div>
      <div class="comparison-gregorian">18 Februari 2026</div>
      <div class="comparison-note">Yang dilihat di langit Indonesia</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .problem-header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
  }

  .problem-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1rem + 3vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .problem-header h2 .accent {
    color: #ef4444;
  }

  .problem-header p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.5rem + 1vw, 1.125rem);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .comparison-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .comparison-visual {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  .comparison-card {
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    min-width: 16rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .comparison-card--wrong {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
  }

  .comparison-card--right {
    background: rgba(254, 207, 70, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 207, 70, 0.25);
  }

  .comparison-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .comparison-card--wrong .comparison-badge {
    color: #ef4444;
  }

  .comparison-card--right .comparison-badge {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }

  .comparison-date {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .comparison-gregorian {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .comparison-note {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .comparison-arrow {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .comparison-arrow {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
